{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d83480bca21d6502","x":-520,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Volstar.canvas]]\n#Volstarian_Dynasty "},
		{"id":"5f79ea125e6c25cf","x":-520,"y":-360,"width":760,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"This is where nearly all shops and goods places are located. There aren't very many magic shops here, maybe 1 but it won't have anything crazy special; the high quality stuff is in the SkyView district. \nIt's a huge market where there are tents of shops lined up everywhere. There are only 10 actual buildings but you can get a number over different things from tent stalls"},
		{"id":"06d64bf411211f85","x":-460,"y":-40,"width":1040,"height":280,"type":"text","text":"\n\nMartins Marvelous Merchandise Is the only magic shop in this district and sells a plethora of goods from simple trick items to actual useful stuff, nothing beyond uncommon as of right now though and prices are high. Inside It will be dark purple and blue themed. Martin himself creates all the items in house and is usually in the back but will often come interact with customers who are spending a lot of gold. Usually customers will deal with Della, his daughter. They are both Orcs and are super flashy. Della will usually try to take you for all you've got.\n\nCurrent stock - Stock is subject to change over time\nCape of the Mountbank - cost - 3200gp\nWand of Lightning Bolts - cost 3200gp\nSovereign Glue - cost 10,000gp\nStaff of Power - cost 25,000gp\n\n\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"8bd4a2d7877ca29f","x":-460,"y":340,"width":520,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Tiffanies Tailory: Run by a Tiefling woman named Tiffany the inside of the shop is filled with suits, dresses and jewelry Tiffany is a charismatic woman who is ridiculously flirty with any good looking customers male or female. The inside of the shop is made of wood and decorated with red and blue curtains and rugs. She sells any and everything clothing related."},
		{"id":"adca63b96c566a4f","x":140,"y":340,"width":560,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Victors Vicious Weaponry \nA dwarven man named Victor runs the place and is rough and tumble. He is super dedicated to his craft and only sells his best work to those who appreciate hard work.\nHe has all the basic armours and weapons you could look for nothing magical \n"},
		{"id":"33ee3c91f4ea83f2","x":-460,"y":600,"width":600,"height":380,"type":"text","text":"Arabella's Apothecary A place with all different kinds of potions Arabella is a younger super energetic nature freak and is a druid at heart. She will geek out over animals, herbs and all kinds of wildlife. She will sell spell components that are related to the trade. \nInside will be covered in greenery and random vials all over the place. Imma just kinda go with it\nStock\n\n3 greater healing potions - cost = 325gp each\n1 superior healing potion - cost = 1000gp\n2 Potion of Supreme healing - cost = 4500gp (16d4 + 40)\n1 potion of pugilism - cost = 300gp\n1 potions of Fire Breath - cost = 225gp"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}